Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:29.42,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,When even the wind had fallen silent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:35.96,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,When even the moonlight had frozen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:39.77,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,That was the day I saw you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:45.14,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,You smiled as you looked at me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:49.08,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I couldn't approach you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:53.45,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Because I don't know you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:01:01.02,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I can't remember you, yet you don't feel strange to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:05.66,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,The eyes watching me, looking a little tired
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:11.73,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I can't erase it, but I'm not happy about it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:20.21,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Your breath, your love, in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:46.00,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Hold my hand, close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:55.41,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,And stay by my side, until the very last day.
